                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 17,
                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Getting broadband lines in the ground isn't about having bandwidth to stream cat videos \u2013 it\u2019s about accessing employment, healthcare, schoolwork, and resources to grow small businesses.\n\nExpanding fiber in rural communities isn\u2019t always commercially feasible, so these much-needed funds will jumpstart connection efforts in Lewis County.\n\nOur rural and ag communities have been passed over for too long, so I\u2019ll keep fighting for federal dollars to power investments like this one.",
                "text_lang": "en",
