                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Great news \u2013 @ProbSolveCaucus endorsed our bipartisan GROWTH Act.\n\nIt will level the playing field for community colleges by opening up access to federal grants for nursing programs.\n\nThis is an important step forward toward addressing healthcare workforce shortages in rural communities and supporting folks pursuing nursing careers in their own communities, no matter where they attend school.",
