                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Hardworking families deserved a reconciliation bill that provides middle class tax cuts, protects Medicaid for working U.S. citizens, and prevents costs from rising even more.\n\nOne that levels the playing field and provides real, durable economic prosperity \u2013 not one that saddles our kids with $4 TRILLION in debt to pay for $118,000 yearly tax giveaways for the top 0.1%.\n\nIt's why I voted no.",
