                "text": "Our rural hospitals are already facing severe financial hardship and are barely breaking even.\n\nThe big bill's Apple Health cuts were engineered to occur after the midterm elections \u2013 when we'll all start feeling shuttered services and higher costs.\nhttps://t.co/WZTTvz9OWY",
